---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Create a workspace with this name.
It prints the new workspace with its id.

USAGE
  holst workspace create <name> [flags]

ARGUMENTS
  name   The name of the new workspace

FLAGS
  -n, --dry-run   Show what would change; change nothing

INHERITED FLAGS
  --output, --verbose, --base-url, --home, --no-cache, --help   as in `holst -h`

EXAMPLES
  $ holst ws create "Design team"
  $ holst ws create "Design team" -n

LEARN MORE
  How a workspace is given: `holst ws -h`.
  Exit codes: `holst help exit-codes`.
